WEBVTT

01:49.530 --> 01:54.940
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.060 --> 01:57.930
[Episode 39]

01:58.020 --> 01:59.550
[9:00]

01:59.580 --> 02:01.340
[Huaipu Hall]

02:02.020 --> 02:06.880
[8 hours ago, at about 9 a.m.]

02:08.030 --> 02:08.960
Song Yimeng.

02:09.400 --> 02:10.130
Song Yimeng!

02:20.770 --> 02:21.560
Nan Heng!

02:23.520 --> 02:24.310
Nan Heng!

02:24.960 --> 02:25.750
Nan Heng,

02:25.800 --> 02:26.750
send some people

02:26.750 --> 02:27.700
to protect the Song family.

02:27.700 --> 02:28.560
Do it now,

02:28.560 --> 02:29.520
or Yiting and my father

02:29.520 --> 02:30.650
will get in trouble.

02:30.980 --> 02:31.790
Trouble?

02:33.440 --> 02:34.579
What trouble?

02:37.280 --> 02:38.420
I know you must find it

02:38.420 --> 02:39.740
puzzling.

02:40.590 --> 02:41.520
In a while,

02:41.520 --> 02:42.520
you'll see Shangguan He

02:42.520 --> 02:44.190
dressed in teal and enter the room.

02:44.190 --> 02:46.430
He'll pull one foot back at the doorsill

02:46.430 --> 02:47.710
and tell you

02:47.710 --> 02:49.150
an off-the-books Qianyu troop

02:49.150 --> 02:50.870
has been secretly planted
in Qianyu Mansion.

02:50.870 --> 02:52.430
Fugui checked the plans
of garrison defenses

02:52.430 --> 02:52.960
and saw

02:52.960 --> 02:54.590
no records of Qianyu Army
being deployed last night.

02:54.590 --> 02:56.710
Shanhu asked his friends
in relevant fields

02:56.710 --> 02:57.960
and found that those people

02:57.960 --> 02:59.520
were soldiers transferred from the borders

02:59.520 --> 03:01.720
to the capital by Chu Guihong in secret.

03:05.960 --> 03:07.000
I-I...

03:07.000 --> 03:09.200
I don't understand what you're saying.

03:09.240 --> 03:10.030
Chief...

03:15.360 --> 03:16.070
Look!

03:17.940 --> 03:20.150
Aren't we going to discuss
something important about Lord Qianyu?

03:20.150 --> 03:21.560
Don't you think it's a bit too early

03:21.560 --> 03:22.820
for intimate contact?

03:23.190 --> 03:24.280
Am I right?

03:30.360 --> 03:31.000
Come here.

03:36.030 --> 03:36.710
Last night,

03:37.240 --> 03:39.240
what did you find in Qianyu Mansion?

03:39.430 --> 03:40.960
You truly guessed it right.

03:41.190 --> 03:42.079
An off-the-books Qianyu troop

03:42.079 --> 03:43.960
has been secretly planted
in Qianyu Mansion.

03:43.960 --> 03:45.280
Fugui checked the plans
of garrison defenses

03:45.280 --> 03:47.120
-and saw no records of Qianyu Army...
-See?

03:47.120 --> 03:49.150
Shanhu asked his friends
in relevant fields,

03:49.150 --> 03:50.680
and found that those people

03:50.800 --> 03:52.430
were soldiers transferred from the borders

03:52.430 --> 03:54.630
to the capital by Chu Guihong in secret.

03:55.520 --> 03:56.310
Nan Heng,

03:56.310 --> 03:57.120
look.

03:57.120 --> 03:58.250
I'm right, aren't I?

03:58.430 --> 04:00.280
That's because I've experienced

04:00.280 --> 04:01.910
all of today's events twice.

04:06.080 --> 04:06.870
It's true.

04:09.710 --> 04:10.590
Trust me.

04:14.030 --> 04:14.520
Then...

04:14.910 --> 04:15.520
Then...

04:16.070 --> 04:17.430
What will happen next?

04:19.269 --> 04:20.070
Next,

04:20.430 --> 04:22.040
the Emperor will be poisoned.

04:22.040 --> 04:24.040
The Song family will be held hostage.

04:24.040 --> 04:24.720
So,

04:24.720 --> 04:25.920
we need to split up into two teams now

04:25.920 --> 04:27.650
and stop those from happening.

04:31.510 --> 04:32.040
Wait.

04:32.040 --> 04:33.170
Why are you nodding?

04:33.270 --> 04:34.040
She just woke up from sleep.

04:34.040 --> 04:35.310
Are her words even believable?

04:35.310 --> 04:36.120
I trust her.

04:38.890 --> 04:42.850
[Qianyu Mansion]

04:42.930 --> 04:45.350
[Kidnap Song Yiting
and her mother as a threat]
[Song Yimeng cooperates]
[Nan Heng shoots Song Yimeng
at the city tower]

04:43.720 --> 04:45.480
You must listen to me this time.

04:45.480 --> 04:47.000
Just stick to the plan.

04:47.510 --> 04:48.630
All the events today are designed

04:48.630 --> 04:51.090
for the hostage situation
on the city tower.

04:51.159 --> 04:53.310
Only after the iconic scenes
happen as scheduled,

04:53.310 --> 04:54.560
can I go back to the modern times

04:54.560 --> 04:56.490
and write a perfect ending for you.

05:04.000 --> 05:05.360
Where is this moth from?

05:10.630 --> 05:12.040
Where is this moth from?

05:12.040 --> 05:13.040
Moth...

05:27.070 --> 05:27.870
What's wrong?

05:29.400 --> 05:30.360
The window...

05:30.650 --> 05:31.780
That butterfly...

05:32.250 --> 05:33.500
And your words...

05:35.100 --> 05:37.430
All of this seems to have happened before.

05:38.310 --> 05:39.680
What do you mean?

05:42.070 --> 05:42.870
I'm right.

05:43.930 --> 05:45.340
It all feels familiar.

05:47.560 --> 05:48.560
I have a question.

05:48.750 --> 05:50.000
Would things repeatedly happen

05:50.000 --> 05:51.430
in this script world?

05:51.800 --> 05:52.820
Or,

05:53.270 --> 05:54.760
does reincarnation exist?

05:54.760 --> 05:55.730
Reincarnation?

05:57.430 --> 05:59.360
You mean "unlimited flow", right?

05:59.560 --> 06:00.360
It does exist.

06:00.510 --> 06:02.600
Song Yimeng experienced it
when she first entered

06:02.600 --> 06:03.530
the script world.

06:03.530 --> 06:04.240
At that time,

06:04.240 --> 06:05.480
she kept getting married.

06:05.480 --> 06:06.680
Things started all over after she died.

06:06.680 --> 06:08.190
In our words, it is called

06:08.190 --> 06:09.250
"stuck with a bug."

06:09.590 --> 06:11.650
Things started again after she died?

06:11.800 --> 06:12.480
Back then,

06:12.480 --> 06:13.830
didn't she consistently
try to avoid Nan Heng

06:13.830 --> 06:14.720
and marry you?

06:14.720 --> 06:16.320
But the story disallowed it,

06:16.360 --> 06:17.800
so she died and was reborn

06:17.800 --> 06:18.390
many times.

06:18.390 --> 06:18.870
Dead.

06:18.870 --> 06:19.510
Reborn.

06:19.510 --> 06:20.560
Then she experienced

06:20.560 --> 06:22.270
the same events
at that given point in time repeatedly?

06:22.270 --> 06:23.000
Yes.

06:27.800 --> 06:29.310
Why do you ask?

06:29.480 --> 06:30.920
When she is reborn,

06:31.330 --> 06:33.300
will she have the memories
of her past lives?

06:33.300 --> 06:34.440
Memories?

06:35.510 --> 06:36.430
That is to say,

06:37.480 --> 06:39.010
she can foresee the future.

06:40.100 --> 06:41.280
Can she?

06:48.630 --> 06:49.930
If that's the case,

06:50.480 --> 06:51.830
she must know all of our plans now,

06:51.830 --> 06:53.070
doesn't she?

07:09.890 --> 07:11.490
Under these circumstances,

07:12.830 --> 07:15.040
I'll have to preempt their attempts

07:15.890 --> 07:17.840
and strike first.

07:19.020 --> 07:20.500
[11:00]

07:20.520 --> 07:23.310
[Imperial Study]

07:27.560 --> 07:28.360
Let me peel it.

07:29.840 --> 07:30.430
Okay.

07:36.600 --> 07:38.000
Father, you eat it first.

07:48.300 --> 07:49.190
Father...

07:50.850 --> 07:52.360
Look how clumsy you are.

07:53.430 --> 07:54.240
Let me peel it.

07:54.260 --> 07:55.040
Wait,

07:55.040 --> 07:55.750
Father.

07:57.130 --> 07:59.260
Did you peel a tangerine for me before?

07:59.950 --> 08:01.240
I'm the Emperor.

08:01.260 --> 08:03.160
When have I ever peeled
tangerines for anyone?

08:03.160 --> 08:04.420
This is the first time.

08:06.410 --> 08:07.210
No.

08:07.680 --> 08:08.480
I...

08:08.480 --> 08:09.430
I find the setting here

08:09.430 --> 08:10.560
very familiar. Why?

08:10.800 --> 08:12.310
When the juice got on you,

08:12.310 --> 08:12.870
I felt

08:12.870 --> 08:14.310
it had happened before.

08:14.680 --> 08:16.410
You're making nonsense again.

08:18.190 --> 08:18.750
I...

08:18.750 --> 08:19.550
Your Majesty!

08:20.080 --> 08:21.300
Your Highness!

08:21.510 --> 08:22.450
General!

08:25.360 --> 08:26.320
Guihong?

08:26.430 --> 08:28.160
Is there a problem with my eyes?

08:30.030 --> 08:31.440
What are you doing?

08:32.470 --> 08:33.270
Your Majesty,

08:34.030 --> 08:35.559
this carries fatal toxins.

08:36.740 --> 08:38.400
What kind of nonsense is that?

08:38.870 --> 08:40.630
Rui bought this red tangerine for me.

08:40.630 --> 08:41.760
How is it poisonous?

08:42.679 --> 08:43.559
Guihong,

08:43.720 --> 08:44.360
I...

08:54.120 --> 08:55.020
Father,

08:55.110 --> 08:56.480
I didn't put poison in it.

08:56.480 --> 08:57.870
I'd never ever have the nerve

08:57.870 --> 08:58.550
to do

08:58.550 --> 09:00.200
an utterly unconscionable thing like that!

09:00.200 --> 09:02.460
Have I determined this is your doing yet?

09:03.030 --> 09:03.840
Chu Guihong,

09:04.670 --> 09:06.400
how did you find out about this?

09:07.410 --> 09:08.940
I just received a report.

09:09.120 --> 09:11.240
The red tangerine vendor was seen

09:11.240 --> 09:12.550
to put poison in his fruit

09:12.550 --> 09:15.030
and then sell some
to the Eighteenth Prince.

09:15.950 --> 09:17.130
I think

09:17.790 --> 09:18.920
someone is plotting

09:19.030 --> 09:20.270
against Your Majesty

09:20.270 --> 09:21.580
and the Eighteenth Prince.

09:21.580 --> 09:22.040
What?

09:22.130 --> 09:22.570
Who

09:22.600 --> 09:23.840
would do this to us?

09:24.960 --> 09:26.790
The late Empress's death anniversary
is approaching.

09:26.790 --> 09:27.790
Red tangerines...

09:27.790 --> 09:29.910
The late Empress's death anniversary
is approaching.

09:29.910 --> 09:31.960
Red tangerines were

09:31.960 --> 09:32.960
Her Majesty's favorite.

09:32.960 --> 09:35.120
were Her Majesty's favorite.

09:36.030 --> 09:37.240
At this time every year,

09:37.240 --> 09:38.200
the Eighteenth Prince

09:38.200 --> 09:40.200
and Your Majesty would eat
red tangerines together

09:40.200 --> 09:41.320
in memory of the late Empress.

09:41.320 --> 09:43.480
How come I feel Heng has said it here too?

09:43.480 --> 09:45.600
Not many people in the palace
know about this.

09:45.600 --> 09:46.910
My guess is

09:47.750 --> 09:48.840
that the plotter

09:49.600 --> 09:50.550
must be

09:51.030 --> 09:53.080
very close to Your Majesty

09:53.080 --> 09:54.610
and the Eighteenth Prince.

09:58.030 --> 09:58.910
Chu Guihong,

09:59.840 --> 10:01.100
what are you implying?

10:02.510 --> 10:03.850
How dare you!

10:04.030 --> 10:05.080
You're hurling

10:05.080 --> 10:07.360
a baseless accusation at the crown prince!

10:07.360 --> 10:07.870
Yeah.

10:07.870 --> 10:08.480
Guihong,

10:08.480 --> 10:10.120
Heng is the crown prince now.

10:10.120 --> 10:11.320
He has no reason to poison Father...

10:11.320 --> 10:12.270
So what?

10:13.030 --> 10:14.150
He has diabolical ambitions.

10:14.150 --> 10:15.510
Out of fear of being replaced

10:15.510 --> 10:16.480
if His Majesty changes his mind,

10:16.480 --> 10:18.810
the crown prince might take a precaution.

10:18.870 --> 10:19.670
Your Majesty,

10:20.550 --> 10:22.010
this could be a rebellion.

10:22.390 --> 10:24.030
To avoid further turmoil,

10:24.200 --> 10:26.860
Your Majesty had better stay
in the bed chamber.

10:32.030 --> 10:33.440
I'll bring Qianyu Army

10:33.560 --> 10:35.960
into the palace to safeguard Your Majesty.

10:42.690 --> 10:43.760
Chu Guihong,

10:44.840 --> 10:46.700
are you trying to confine me here?

10:51.570 --> 10:53.120
Protecting the sovereign

10:54.130 --> 10:55.590
is my duty as an officer.

11:11.130 --> 11:17.900
[Huanning Hall]

11:13.320 --> 11:14.150
We're late.

11:18.120 --> 11:19.360
The Emperor has ordered

11:19.360 --> 11:20.550
to relieve the Imperial Guards.

11:20.550 --> 11:22.180
Have this place guarded now.

11:22.480 --> 11:23.720
Without my permission,

11:23.720 --> 11:25.780
no one can be admitted to the chamber.

11:25.960 --> 11:27.150
If there are violators,

11:27.150 --> 11:27.750
kill them.

11:28.480 --> 11:29.270
Got it.

11:31.910 --> 11:32.550
Remember,

11:33.240 --> 11:34.880
do whatever it takes to make him write

11:34.880 --> 11:37.560
an imperial edict to eradicate Nan Heng.

11:39.640 --> 11:40.870
Rest assured, General.

11:40.870 --> 11:42.470
I'll get the imperial edict.

11:51.910 --> 11:52.910
Last time,

11:52.910 --> 11:54.510
he took action ahead of time.

11:54.760 --> 11:56.430
Why is he doing it again now?

11:56.590 --> 11:57.660
Qianyu Army

11:57.870 --> 12:00.130
has quickly taken control of the palace.

12:02.200 --> 12:03.200
Is the Emperor...

12:04.390 --> 12:05.270
We must find out a way

12:05.270 --> 12:06.530
to rescue the Emperor.

12:07.480 --> 12:08.240
H-Heng...

12:08.240 --> 12:09.040
Heng!

12:09.120 --> 12:09.910
Heng!

12:10.550 --> 12:11.240
I...

12:12.790 --> 12:13.840
Why are you here?

12:17.120 --> 12:18.440
When Father attracted their attention,

12:18.440 --> 12:20.970
I snuck out of the hall
through a hole for dogs.

12:23.510 --> 12:24.320
That's the whole story.

12:24.320 --> 12:26.100
He must've gone crazy!

12:26.270 --> 12:28.070
He boldly confined the Emperor?

12:28.840 --> 12:29.870
This is bad.

12:30.030 --> 12:31.650
We must rescue Father now.

12:32.240 --> 12:32.870
Heng,

12:32.870 --> 12:33.670
listen,

12:33.750 --> 12:34.750
before I escaped,

12:34.750 --> 12:36.030
Father reminded me

12:36.030 --> 12:36.750
to warn you

12:36.750 --> 12:37.550
not to act rashly.

12:37.550 --> 12:38.120
He will

12:38.120 --> 12:39.270
try stalling for time.

12:39.270 --> 12:40.480
Father also said,

12:40.670 --> 12:41.480
my cousin...

12:42.920 --> 12:43.670
Chu Guihong

12:43.670 --> 12:45.670
is eager to get
an imperial edict to attack you.

12:45.670 --> 12:46.670
Going out there now

12:46.670 --> 12:48.670
is handing yourself over, isn't it?

12:48.960 --> 12:49.960
He's right.

12:50.630 --> 12:52.720
The first time the Emperor got in danger,

12:52.720 --> 12:54.720
many people in the palace witnessed

12:54.750 --> 12:55.790
Nan Rui

12:55.790 --> 12:57.790
feeding him poisonous tangerines.

12:58.180 --> 12:59.870
But things are different this time.

12:59.870 --> 13:02.050
A street vendor's testimony alone

13:02.200 --> 13:03.960
can hardly convince everyone.

13:03.980 --> 13:04.600
What?

13:04.600 --> 13:05.030
It...

13:05.960 --> 13:07.320
When did I ever poison my father?

13:07.320 --> 13:08.720
It was done by Chu Guihong.

13:08.720 --> 13:09.780
He just framed you.

13:12.000 --> 13:14.330
Chu Guihong put poison in the tangerines?

13:15.270 --> 13:16.000
That's impossible.

13:16.000 --> 13:16.360
H-H-He...

13:16.360 --> 13:17.760
How could he have done it?

13:17.870 --> 13:20.270
It was he who stopped Father
from eating the tangerines.

13:20.270 --> 13:21.080
Right.

13:21.510 --> 13:23.600
What made Chu Guihong
change his plan this time?

13:23.600 --> 13:24.550
He has

13:25.080 --> 13:26.910
either predicted our action,

13:27.080 --> 13:27.960
or...

13:29.000 --> 13:31.240
Is he also part of the unlimited flow now?

13:31.240 --> 13:32.270
Does he have any memories

13:32.270 --> 13:33.510
of the last two occasions?

13:33.510 --> 13:34.440
Definitely not.

13:34.790 --> 13:35.640
Then he must have

13:35.640 --> 13:37.150
got some information in advance,

13:37.150 --> 13:38.390
which changed his mind.

13:38.390 --> 13:39.320
But his ultimate goal remains.

13:39.320 --> 13:40.030
What "unlimited flow"?

13:40.030 --> 13:41.490
It is to kill you in person.

13:42.320 --> 13:43.120
Wait.

13:43.140 --> 13:44.720
Why is this all so befuddling?

13:44.720 --> 13:45.550
What do you mean

13:45.550 --> 13:46.480
by "unlimited flow"?

13:46.480 --> 13:47.790
What... I...

13:47.790 --> 13:48.440
I know each word,

13:48.440 --> 13:49.200
but I'm puzzled

13:49.200 --> 13:50.120
when they combine.

13:50.120 --> 13:51.600
We'll explain it to you later.

13:51.600 --> 13:53.200
Now, I'll ask Fugui to send

13:53.360 --> 13:54.630
you and my mother

13:54.630 --> 13:56.290
to the Waning River Crescent.

13:56.390 --> 13:56.980
Okay.

13:57.790 --> 13:59.630
We lost on the previous two occasions

13:59.630 --> 14:01.690
due to the lack of military strength.

14:02.120 --> 14:03.000
This time,

14:04.670 --> 14:06.470
I'm going to meet someone first.

14:07.370 --> 14:09.470
[Righteousness]

14:08.720 --> 14:09.640
Stop!

14:11.000 --> 14:12.720
You've secretly transferred
Qianyu Army to the capital.

14:12.720 --> 14:14.600
Why do you still need the command token?

14:14.600 --> 14:15.480
As I told you,

14:16.440 --> 14:18.030
I must change my fate.

14:18.600 --> 14:20.480
What don't you understand?

14:20.630 --> 14:21.670
After finishing all the iconic scenes,

14:21.670 --> 14:22.910
I'll write a new ending

14:22.910 --> 14:23.720
to your satisfaction!

14:23.720 --> 14:25.850
No need to go the extra length, Father.

14:26.910 --> 14:28.510
If I become the next emperor,

14:29.030 --> 14:30.760
you'll be the Imperial Father.

14:31.320 --> 14:33.630
The cold palace
where Nan Heng used to be confined

14:33.630 --> 14:35.150
must be familiar to you.

14:35.670 --> 14:37.000
Would you like to

14:37.150 --> 14:39.440
spend the rest of your life there?

14:39.600 --> 14:40.530
Chu Guihong!

14:40.720 --> 14:42.150
You promised to let me
go back to the modern times!

14:42.150 --> 14:43.610
-You...
-If you do go back,

14:43.870 --> 14:46.030
my fate will fall in the palm
of your hand again, won it?

14:46.030 --> 14:46.670
You...

14:49.000 --> 14:50.030
From now on,

14:51.270 --> 14:53.600
only I can decide my fate.

14:55.680 --> 14:58.020
If you don't want
to live in the cold palace--

14:58.020 --> 14:59.600
in the script, Nan Heng turns Song Yimeng

14:59.600 --> 15:02.030
into a mutilated living corpse,
doesn't he?

15:02.030 --> 15:03.810
How do you like it if you end up

15:04.750 --> 15:05.550
that way?

15:08.840 --> 15:09.820
Stay!

15:11.440 --> 15:12.490
Guards!

15:12.720 --> 15:14.000
I need help!

15:16.200 --> 15:17.000
Guards!

15:18.240 --> 15:19.330
Help me!

15:20.670 --> 15:21.240
Hurry.

15:21.240 --> 15:21.960
Take Chu...

15:22.500 --> 15:23.390
I am Lord Qianyu.

15:23.390 --> 15:24.450
What are you doing?

15:24.510 --> 15:25.320
Take him away.

15:25.840 --> 15:26.600
Chu Guihong,

15:26.600 --> 15:27.680
you crazy man!

15:27.750 --> 15:28.840
I curse you!

15:28.910 --> 15:29.670
When I go back,

15:29.670 --> 15:31.120
I'll make you die in the script

15:31.120 --> 15:32.240
a thousand times!

15:34.510 --> 15:35.320
Too bad

15:36.600 --> 15:38.240
that you can never go back.

15:40.350 --> 15:41.200
I'm Lord Qianyu.

15:41.200 --> 15:42.200
How dare you defy me?

15:42.200 --> 15:42.840
Move!

15:43.720 --> 15:44.480
Let go of me!

15:44.480 --> 15:45.210
Keep moving!

15:45.910 --> 15:47.200
I'm Lord Qianyu!

15:47.200 --> 15:47.750
You...

16:21.580 --> 16:22.380
Nan Heng!

16:30.320 --> 16:31.120
Don't yell.

16:32.380 --> 16:33.200
Nan Heng,

16:33.360 --> 16:35.200
Chu Guihong has gone crazy.

16:35.390 --> 16:37.150
He placed 5,000 soldiers outside the city.

16:37.150 --> 16:37.870
Precisely at nine tonight,

16:37.870 --> 16:39.070
they'll besiege you.

16:39.320 --> 16:40.200
If you don't want to die,

16:40.200 --> 16:42.360
quickly finish the iconic scenes
with Song Yimeng.

16:42.360 --> 16:43.030
When I'm back to...

16:43.030 --> 16:45.290
Still thinking about the iconic scenes?

16:46.000 --> 16:48.130
Do you know you've already died twice?

16:48.460 --> 16:49.590
I've died twice?

16:50.480 --> 16:51.320
When?

16:52.570 --> 16:54.030
According to Song Yimeng,

16:54.240 --> 16:55.380
First,

16:55.630 --> 16:57.000
Rong Hua killed you.

16:57.030 --> 16:57.840
Then,

16:58.030 --> 16:59.000
Chu Guihong killed you.

16:59.000 --> 17:00.800
It was I who collected your body.

17:03.320 --> 17:05.250
That reincarnation thing is true.

17:05.880 --> 17:06.810
I'm telling you,

17:07.400 --> 17:09.349
a new round of reincarnation has begun.

17:09.349 --> 17:10.680
If you want to survive,

17:10.780 --> 17:12.240
collaborate with me

17:12.310 --> 17:13.720
to fight Chu Guihong.

17:14.069 --> 17:15.530
Fight Chu Guihong?

17:16.589 --> 17:17.920
Are you out of your mind?

17:20.060 --> 17:21.240
I'm just a screenwriter.

17:21.240 --> 17:21.960
I know how to type,

17:21.960 --> 17:23.089
but not how to fight.

17:25.680 --> 17:27.970
You looked down on us
fictional characters, didn't you?

17:27.970 --> 17:28.680
I...

17:28.680 --> 17:30.080
Weren't you omnipotent?

17:33.770 --> 17:34.890
How about this?

17:35.000 --> 17:36.070
You're here already.

17:36.070 --> 17:37.030
Might as well make this visit count,

17:37.030 --> 17:37.720
right?

17:37.790 --> 17:38.880
Help me out of here.

17:38.880 --> 17:40.030
I'll hide somewhere.

17:40.030 --> 17:42.070
Then, you guys can
proceed to political struggles

17:42.070 --> 17:43.030
or fights.

17:43.110 --> 17:44.720
I won't hold you back, okay?

17:44.720 --> 17:46.310
Hide somewhere?

17:46.550 --> 17:47.270
This is a critical time.

17:47.270 --> 17:48.400
Are you even a man?

17:48.960 --> 17:50.850
Don't be so mean.

17:51.000 --> 17:53.200
I'm just pointing out my incompetence,

17:53.200 --> 17:53.920
aren't I?

17:54.510 --> 17:55.720
I'm a tiny screenwriter,

17:55.720 --> 17:56.550
not the male lead.

17:56.550 --> 17:58.270
These glorious moments
of fighting and killing

17:58.270 --> 17:59.800
should be reserved for you.

18:03.310 --> 18:04.110
Nan Heng.

18:06.540 --> 18:07.450
Heng...

18:08.960 --> 18:10.310
My dearest Heng,

18:10.310 --> 18:11.350
I've already had a hard time

18:11.350 --> 18:12.790
in reality because of you.

18:12.790 --> 18:13.510
I-In the script world,

18:13.510 --> 18:14.400
please spare me from trouble.

18:14.400 --> 18:15.270
Cut the crap.

18:15.270 --> 18:16.030
I...

18:16.510 --> 18:17.720
No matter who you are,

18:18.240 --> 18:20.100
you can only be Lord Qianyu today.

18:21.500 --> 18:22.850
Lord Qianyu?

18:28.390 --> 18:29.450
Have some water.

18:30.790 --> 18:31.590
Thank you.

18:41.480 --> 18:42.270
Nan Heng,

18:44.070 --> 18:45.490
how are you holding up?

18:45.640 --> 18:46.790
If you really can't manage...

18:46.790 --> 18:47.510
Don't worry.

18:47.510 --> 18:47.880
I...

18:48.130 --> 18:49.060
I'm coping well.

18:50.720 --> 18:52.300
Don’t tell me you can die

18:52.510 --> 18:54.060
and let reincarnation happen again

18:54.060 --> 18:55.340
if the worst happens.

18:56.640 --> 18:57.510
Listen,

18:58.440 --> 18:59.240
this time,

18:59.440 --> 19:01.240
I won’t let you get hurt.

19:02.510 --> 19:04.120
But Chu Guihong commands

19:04.200 --> 19:05.830
5,000 soldiers now.

19:05.920 --> 19:07.880
Lord Qianyu hasn't agreed to help us yet.

19:07.880 --> 19:10.210
What do you have
to fight Chu Guihong with?

19:10.480 --> 19:12.080
Don't tell me you can count on

19:12.440 --> 19:14.240
your plot armor as the male lead.

19:15.920 --> 19:17.580
As you said, I'm the male lead.

19:18.240 --> 19:19.450
The male lead has to

19:19.830 --> 19:20.750
come up with

19:20.750 --> 19:23.210
certain solutions
that only he can think of.

19:23.880 --> 19:24.880
What's your plan?

19:27.070 --> 19:29.110
My uncle told me before his execution

19:29.110 --> 19:31.310
that he had 3,000 private soldiers
outside the city.

19:31.310 --> 19:32.510
I have 3,000 private soldiers

19:32.510 --> 19:34.270
stationing outside the city in secret.

19:34.270 --> 19:35.550
Once Your Highness gives an order,

19:35.550 --> 19:37.350
they'll raid the capital
from inside and outside.

19:37.350 --> 19:40.350
The capital prefecture's office
has failed attempt to find this troop.

19:40.350 --> 19:41.160
Therefore,

19:41.440 --> 19:43.700
I asked Yao Qian
to lead the Nightwalkers

19:43.960 --> 19:45.110
to look for clues.

19:45.400 --> 19:47.440
They'll search every corner
on the outskirts

19:47.440 --> 19:49.170
till these soldiers are found.

19:50.920 --> 19:53.110
But it was you who revealed
Chancellor Gao's crimes.

19:53.110 --> 19:54.440
Will his private soldiers

19:54.440 --> 19:55.700
follow your commands?

19:56.550 --> 19:59.350
I had Yao Qian take
a crown prince's edict with him.

19:59.920 --> 20:01.240
These soldiers can choose to hide

20:01.240 --> 20:03.030
and conceal their identities forever,

20:03.030 --> 20:04.750
or to make amends by following me

20:04.750 --> 20:05.880
to quell the unrest.

20:06.400 --> 20:07.440
I believe most of them

20:07.440 --> 20:08.700
will go for the latter.

20:10.440 --> 20:12.030
The more people join us,

20:12.960 --> 20:14.820
the higher the odds of us winning.

20:17.790 --> 20:18.880
More people?

20:21.590 --> 20:22.670
Perhaps

20:23.750 --> 20:26.090
before your uncle's private soldiers
enter the capital,

20:26.090 --> 20:27.550
we can recruit some people

20:27.640 --> 20:29.770
and have them stall Chu Guihong for us.

20:29.920 --> 20:30.960
What people?

20:33.520 --> 20:34.560
Officials.

20:34.710 --> 20:35.720
People from the martial arts world.

20:35.720 --> 20:36.960
Residents in the capital.

20:36.960 --> 20:38.360
They can all be our aides.

20:45.860 --> 20:47.590
I-I'm having a stomachache.

20:50.680 --> 20:51.270
Jia Ruru,

20:51.270 --> 20:52.350
please hear me out.

20:55.960 --> 20:57.000
Y-You...

20:57.000 --> 20:57.980
Mrs. Li,

20:58.160 --> 21:00.170
why wouldn't he help us?

21:00.240 --> 21:00.960
Yunlong and I

21:00.960 --> 21:02.590
even offered him a luminous pearl.

21:02.590 --> 21:03.720
This big.

21:07.350 --> 21:08.790
To fear is human.

21:09.110 --> 21:10.590
The idea of fighting Chu Guihong

21:10.590 --> 21:13.120
who holds a large army,
scares them even more.

21:14.920 --> 21:17.120
I wish there were helpers from thin air.

21:17.200 --> 21:17.790
Mrs. Li!

21:18.400 --> 21:19.070
Mrs. Li.

21:20.310 --> 21:21.030
Mrs. Shangguan

21:21.030 --> 21:22.240
and Mr. Song are here.

21:28.200 --> 21:29.000
Dad!

21:29.790 --> 21:30.590
Yimeng,

21:31.000 --> 21:32.510
what's the emergency?

21:32.510 --> 21:34.110
Why did you tell us to come?

21:34.550 --> 21:35.400
Let's talk over there.

21:35.400 --> 21:36.030
Come on.

21:36.160 --> 21:37.590
The Eighteenth Prince is here as well?

21:37.590 --> 21:38.920
Nan Heng needs to
explain something to him.

21:38.920 --> 21:40.110
I just hope he won't faint

21:40.110 --> 21:41.160
upon hearing Heng's words.

21:41.160 --> 21:41.960
Faint?

21:42.160 --> 21:43.560
What exactly is going on?

21:50.010 --> 21:51.080
Jixiang,

21:51.350 --> 21:53.640
they must've reached the part
about the script world.

21:53.640 --> 21:55.510
When I first heard it,

21:55.510 --> 21:57.070
I reacted the same way.

21:59.640 --> 22:01.590
Now, they must be
talking about the reincarnation.

22:01.590 --> 22:04.120
This beautiful world
is filled with wonders.

22:04.160 --> 22:06.220
Ignorant people are easily shocked.

22:06.740 --> 22:08.440
The Eighteenth Prince and you

22:08.440 --> 22:10.560
seldom travel far.

22:11.030 --> 22:12.840
It's understandable for people

22:13.000 --> 22:14.310
with scanty information like you

22:14.310 --> 22:15.720
not to know these bizarre things.

22:15.720 --> 22:17.380
Hope you don't feel inferior.

22:17.920 --> 22:20.250
[Jixiang]

22:24.310 --> 22:25.720
I've said too much.

22:26.270 --> 22:27.800
You need time to process it.

22:36.780 --> 22:39.210
Though Chu Guihong
has set you up three times,

22:39.210 --> 22:41.140
his real target has always been me.

22:42.270 --> 22:43.070
If

22:43.820 --> 22:45.860
you can't bring yourself to fight him,

22:45.860 --> 22:46.860
-I will...
-Heng.

22:49.550 --> 22:50.350
Look,

22:51.270 --> 22:52.590
you died so many times.

22:53.790 --> 22:55.590
You must've been in a lot of pain.

22:57.310 --> 22:58.310
This is all my fault.

22:58.310 --> 22:59.350
When I first bought
those red tangerines,

22:59.350 --> 23:01.110
if I had discovered the poison in them...

23:01.110 --> 23:01.750
No.

23:01.750 --> 23:04.680
I shouldn't have bought
those red tangerines at all.

23:05.110 --> 23:05.440
Wait.

23:05.440 --> 23:07.370
Do you understand what I'm saying?

23:07.640 --> 23:08.440
I do.

23:08.460 --> 23:10.610
Thoroughly and completely.

23:10.880 --> 23:11.880
You're saying

23:11.910 --> 23:12.830
that the Nightwalkers and you

23:12.830 --> 23:15.160
will lure Chu Guihong's rebel forces
to the South City

23:15.160 --> 23:16.070
to create a chance for me

23:16.070 --> 23:17.200
to lead 300 Xuanjia soldiers

23:17.200 --> 23:19.600
to charge into the palace
to rescue Father.

23:20.780 --> 23:21.750
But, Heng,

23:22.550 --> 23:24.750
we only have a small number of soldiers.

23:24.750 --> 23:26.960
You've been defeated by Chu Guihong twice.

23:26.960 --> 23:27.920
What if

23:27.940 --> 23:30.060
you die again?

23:35.400 --> 23:36.440
But we've gone this far now.

23:36.440 --> 23:36.920
I...

23:37.960 --> 23:39.000
I have an idea.

23:39.400 --> 23:40.930
See if you find it feasible.

23:42.000 --> 23:43.440
I'll lead Xuanjia Army to lie in ambush

23:43.440 --> 23:45.040
in the South City in advance,

23:45.350 --> 23:47.720
while you lure Chu Guihong
to go there alone.

23:47.720 --> 23:48.720
Once he falls into our trap,

23:48.720 --> 23:50.790
I'll suddenly appear from nowhere.

23:50.790 --> 23:51.920
He'll be thrown into utter panic

23:51.920 --> 23:52.880
and erupt into fury.

23:52.880 --> 23:54.830
We'll be able to change our fate
when that happens.

23:54.830 --> 23:55.400
Isn't it a good idea?

23:55.400 --> 23:56.240
Not at all.

23:57.440 --> 23:58.470
Heng,

23:58.790 --> 24:00.160
you can count on me, your brother!

24:00.160 --> 24:01.660
Stop with that gibberish.

24:01.830 --> 24:02.690
Just do as I say.

24:02.750 --> 24:03.680
I'll head to the South City.

24:03.680 --> 24:04.830
You'll storm the palace.

24:04.830 --> 24:05.790
But...

24:06.270 --> 24:07.860
Without you...

24:08.240 --> 24:09.900
If I do it alone, I'm afraid...

24:11.000 --> 24:13.000
Those 300 Xuanjia soldiers
will be with you, right?

24:13.000 --> 24:13.890
Plus, that great fighter

24:13.890 --> 24:15.680
Jixiang will await you in the palace.

24:15.680 --> 24:17.410
I'm sure you can rescue Father.

24:17.920 --> 24:18.750
Don't worry.

24:25.160 --> 24:25.830
Nan Rui,

24:26.880 --> 24:28.070
you are my brother.

24:28.640 --> 24:29.880
You can definitely do

24:30.480 --> 24:31.590
what I can,

24:31.790 --> 24:33.520
or even perform better than me.

24:34.000 --> 24:35.260
Besides, don't forget

24:37.920 --> 24:39.720
that you are heaven's chosen one

24:40.880 --> 24:43.140
and Great Jing's symbol
of good fortune.

25:01.400 --> 25:02.200
Okay.

25:03.290 --> 25:04.770
I'll protect the palace.

25:05.000 --> 25:06.600
You'll protect the capital.

25:07.270 --> 25:08.640
The two of us

25:10.350 --> 25:12.350
will definitely survive this time.

25:20.510 --> 25:21.440
What did you say?

25:22.310 --> 25:24.450
Chu Guihong is going to start a coup?

25:25.880 --> 25:27.200
In less than six hours,

25:27.200 --> 25:28.000
Qianyu rebels

25:28.000 --> 25:29.330
will enter the capital.

25:29.400 --> 25:30.720
How is that possible?

25:31.300 --> 25:33.200
Lord Qianyu is reputed for his loyalty.

25:33.200 --> 25:35.800
Why would he allow his son
to rise in rebellion?

25:36.750 --> 25:37.590
Dad,

25:37.610 --> 25:38.850
I don't have time

25:39.070 --> 25:40.730
to explain everything to you.

25:40.750 --> 25:41.510
But we must

25:41.510 --> 25:43.000
stop Chu Guihong now.

25:43.000 --> 25:44.480
Otherwise, Nan Heng, his people

25:44.480 --> 25:46.940
and the entire Song family
will be in danger.

25:46.960 --> 25:47.750
My goodness.

25:48.820 --> 25:50.380
What can we do?

25:51.640 --> 25:52.560
Alright.

25:52.680 --> 25:53.830
Say no more.

25:54.000 --> 25:55.660
It's just that this matter...

25:55.720 --> 25:56.810
I...

25:57.680 --> 25:58.480
Dad,

25:59.750 --> 26:00.920
if Great Jing is in jeopardy,

26:00.920 --> 26:02.350
will you brave all dangers

26:02.350 --> 26:03.710
to protect the country?

26:05.550 --> 26:07.160
This is my obligation.

26:07.240 --> 26:09.100
I'll resolutely fulfill my duty.

26:09.750 --> 26:10.720
That's enough.

26:11.960 --> 26:12.680
Yiting,

26:12.920 --> 26:13.510
what about you?

26:13.510 --> 26:14.530
Will you do it too?

26:14.680 --> 26:16.310
No need to give me lectures on morals.

26:16.310 --> 26:17.110
I will go

26:17.110 --> 26:18.350
wherever you go.

26:20.350 --> 26:21.160
Madam,

26:21.680 --> 26:22.540
what about you?

26:23.950 --> 26:25.240
M-Me?

26:27.110 --> 26:27.700
I...

26:28.270 --> 26:28.880
I...

26:28.880 --> 26:30.200
I'm gutless and afraid of death.

26:30.200 --> 26:31.240
I'm weak and...

26:31.240 --> 26:32.090
You show great strength

26:32.090 --> 26:33.480
when you hit me.

26:33.590 --> 26:34.070
Can...

26:34.070 --> 26:35.350
can that be the same thing?

26:35.350 --> 26:35.960
Cut it out.

26:36.480 --> 26:36.830
Tsk.

26:38.720 --> 26:39.850
What about you guys?

26:46.920 --> 26:47.720
It's okay.

26:48.000 --> 26:49.600
If you are afraid,

26:49.680 --> 26:50.830
you may leave now.

26:51.030 --> 26:51.790
I won't force you to stay.

26:51.790 --> 26:52.880
Let's go!

26:58.560 --> 26:59.110
They...

26:59.140 --> 27:00.310
They really left?

27:07.250 --> 27:09.370
There are only the four of us now.

27:10.480 --> 27:11.280
Nonetheless,

27:11.510 --> 27:12.480
every new helper

27:12.720 --> 27:14.270
represents new hope.

27:14.720 --> 27:15.350
Right?

27:24.480 --> 27:25.160
Your Highness!

27:25.160 --> 27:26.020
Your Highness!

27:27.480 --> 27:29.540
Your Highness, we'll all go with you.

27:33.070 --> 27:34.400
I'll make those who dare to hurt

27:34.400 --> 27:35.680
the Song family pay a price!

27:35.680 --> 27:36.270
This

27:36.270 --> 27:37.070
can't move fast.

27:37.070 --> 27:38.530
I'll go get some more rods.

27:42.500 --> 27:44.740
Where did you get all these?

27:45.000 --> 27:46.880
They were lying around
in the Waning River Crescent's Hall.

27:46.880 --> 27:48.000
Put them down now.

27:48.000 --> 27:50.800
I'm not planning to send you
onto the battlefield.

27:53.110 --> 27:53.920
Yimeng,

27:54.070 --> 27:55.930
what are you planning for us then?

27:56.510 --> 27:57.960
I'm taking you lot to the South City

27:57.960 --> 27:59.360
to join the Nightwalkers

28:00.000 --> 28:00.920
in stallling Chu Guihong,

28:00.920 --> 28:03.920
so he can't unite
with Qianyu reinforcements in time.

28:06.220 --> 28:09.120
[Clear Waters and Serene Woods]

28:09.750 --> 28:10.610
Your Highness,

28:11.110 --> 28:12.480
you gave me a drink
before a battle starts.

28:12.480 --> 28:14.160
It means you're discarding me.

28:14.160 --> 28:15.960
How could Your Highness be so cruel to me?

28:15.960 --> 28:17.530
How am I discarding you?

28:17.720 --> 28:20.510
I'm simply letting you
accompany Rui to the palace.

28:20.510 --> 28:21.370
Your Highness,

28:21.720 --> 28:23.440
whenever you're up
for an important mission,

28:23.440 --> 28:24.550
you'd always discard me

28:24.550 --> 28:26.280
and bring Chu He along instead.

28:26.350 --> 28:27.180
Your Highness,

28:27.180 --> 28:28.920
Lord Qianyu is his godfather.

28:29.480 --> 28:30.830
Chu He might harm you!

28:32.470 --> 28:33.350
Let me ask you.

28:33.790 --> 28:35.120
Who is the Emperor to me?

28:35.480 --> 28:36.270
Your father.

28:36.640 --> 28:37.680
What about Rui?

28:37.790 --> 28:38.590
Your brother.

28:38.960 --> 28:41.640
I'm assigning you to protect
my father and brother.

28:41.640 --> 28:43.770
Yet you think of it as a trivial matter?

28:46.550 --> 28:48.010
Your Highness, do you mean

28:48.270 --> 28:50.110
I'm more important than Chu He?

28:57.880 --> 29:00.720
It's unnecessary
to compare yourself with others.

29:00.720 --> 29:01.920
Over all these years,

29:02.310 --> 29:04.400
we've braved many deadly dangers together.

29:04.400 --> 29:05.240
In my heart,

29:06.070 --> 29:07.530
you're already my family.

29:09.260 --> 29:10.320
Do you understand?

29:11.110 --> 29:11.960
Rest assured, Your Highness.

29:11.960 --> 29:13.160
I will complete this important task

29:13.160 --> 29:14.420
Your Highness gave me.

29:22.730 --> 29:23.660
Your Highness,

29:23.830 --> 29:27.430
I'm heading to protect
your father-in-law and brother-in-law.

29:29.560 --> 29:30.510
Guys,

29:29.660 --> 29:32.710
[Big Fortune]

29:30.540 --> 29:32.510
I'm not bragging here.

29:32.790 --> 29:34.880
When I was only 15 years old,

29:35.350 --> 29:36.720
I met a gang of bandits in the woods

29:36.720 --> 29:38.480
on the outskirts of the capital.

29:38.480 --> 29:39.750
Guess what?

29:39.750 --> 29:40.880
I stood up to them...

29:42.110 --> 29:43.270
I beat down ten of them on my own

29:43.270 --> 29:44.730
and didn't get hurt at all.

29:44.790 --> 29:45.660
How impressive.

29:45.660 --> 29:48.120
You think that's a remarkable achievement?

29:48.440 --> 29:49.240
Shanhu,

29:49.720 --> 29:50.750
when I was being chased after

29:50.750 --> 29:52.920
by officers and soldiers
in Jiangnan Province,

29:52.920 --> 29:55.350
I defeated 100 enemies and safely escaped.

29:55.350 --> 29:56.400
100?

29:56.510 --> 29:57.400
100!

29:57.400 --> 29:58.490
That's amazing.

29:58.550 --> 29:59.350
Yunlong,

29:59.440 --> 30:01.570
how many people can you fight at a time?

30:01.640 --> 30:02.200
One.

30:03.910 --> 30:06.140
Yunlong, you're seldom this humble.

30:06.270 --> 30:08.530
I only have one target now-- Chu Guihong.

30:09.350 --> 30:11.610
He's considered
as Great Jing's God of War.

30:11.610 --> 30:13.000
Just leave him to Chief.

30:13.350 --> 30:14.390
We should

30:14.550 --> 30:15.830
stay out of it.

30:17.070 --> 30:17.870
Shangguan He,

30:18.060 --> 30:20.190
[Big Fortune]

30:18.510 --> 30:20.440
are you slacking off again?

30:20.790 --> 30:21.720
Mrs. Shangguan,

30:21.880 --> 30:23.440
I'm going out to dig for information.

30:23.440 --> 30:24.240
You guys talk.

30:25.420 --> 30:26.400
Have you done the preparation

30:26.400 --> 30:27.200
for the ambush against Qianyu Army?

30:27.200 --> 30:27.640
Hurry up.

30:27.640 --> 30:28.310
Go get it done!

30:27.690 --> 30:32.350
[Big Fortune]

30:28.310 --> 30:29.200
Don't stick around here.

30:29.200 --> 30:29.960
Hurry!

30:30.160 --> 30:30.960
Move!

30:31.070 --> 30:31.530
Come on.

30:33.790 --> 30:34.590
What's in it?

30:37.110 --> 30:38.110
Wedding apparel.

30:38.270 --> 30:39.440
Wedding apparel?

30:39.840 --> 30:40.660
For whom?

30:45.310 --> 30:46.640
We're getting married?

30:47.550 --> 30:48.350
Right now?

30:48.830 --> 30:49.640
Right here?

30:50.590 --> 30:52.110
Shouldn't our wedding include

30:52.110 --> 30:53.050
proper rituals

30:53.070 --> 30:54.340
and our friends and family?

30:54.340 --> 30:55.240
I don't care for

30:55.240 --> 30:55.830
rituals

30:55.830 --> 30:56.640
and audience.

30:57.160 --> 30:58.000
Our marriage

30:58.000 --> 30:59.330
is only about you and me.

31:00.000 --> 31:01.800
Since you truly want to marry me,

31:02.160 --> 31:03.870
we might as well get married today.

31:03.870 --> 31:04.790
Yiting,

31:06.000 --> 31:07.440
if I can come back alive,

31:07.510 --> 31:09.510
the first thing I'll do is marry you.

31:09.570 --> 31:11.300
Yimeng told me

31:11.720 --> 31:13.850
that men who make promises of that kind

31:14.270 --> 31:15.440
would usually end up

31:15.750 --> 31:16.720
tragically.

31:17.820 --> 31:18.920
The tombs of some of them

31:18.920 --> 31:20.320
are even nowhere to find.

31:21.240 --> 31:22.110
Shangguan He,

31:22.510 --> 31:23.270
Today,

31:23.690 --> 31:24.330
I will

31:24.720 --> 31:26.120
either become your wife,

31:26.440 --> 31:27.210
or...

31:30.220 --> 31:31.720
cut your hair off

31:31.720 --> 31:32.850
and tie it with mine.

31:32.880 --> 31:34.070
As our hair strands entwine,

31:34.070 --> 31:36.000
nothing can part this love divine.

31:48.040 --> 31:49.910
Let the sky and earth be our witnesses.

31:49.910 --> 31:51.240
We vow to the sun and moon

31:51.980 --> 31:53.110
before this red knot

31:54.180 --> 31:56.040
that we will be partners for life.

31:56.640 --> 31:57.480
Song Yiting,

31:58.310 --> 32:00.590
do you take me, Shangguan He,
to be your husband?

32:00.590 --> 32:01.750
From now on...

32:02.640 --> 32:03.430
No.

32:03.810 --> 32:05.640
You don't want to get married now?

32:05.640 --> 32:06.590
I mean,

32:07.030 --> 32:08.630
that is not a good enough vow.

32:10.160 --> 32:11.960
Isn't that a common wedding vow?

32:12.270 --> 32:13.470
Let me take care of it.

32:16.620 --> 32:17.620
Shangguan He,

32:18.590 --> 32:20.260
do you take me

32:20.290 --> 32:21.890
to be your lifelong partner?

32:22.060 --> 32:23.580
From now on,

32:23.600 --> 32:24.950
for richer

32:25.030 --> 32:26.200
or for poorer,

32:26.510 --> 32:27.570
in health

32:27.880 --> 32:29.030
and in sickness,

32:29.590 --> 32:30.960
will you comfort me,

32:30.960 --> 32:31.750
love me,

32:31.750 --> 32:32.680
protect me,

32:32.680 --> 32:33.640
respect me

32:33.830 --> 32:34.960
and stay with me

32:35.900 --> 32:37.210
till death

32:37.640 --> 32:38.830
do us part?

32:40.810 --> 32:41.940
Yes, I do.

32:43.750 --> 32:44.640
I do too.

32:46.070 --> 32:48.150
You've taken the initiative many times.

32:48.150 --> 32:49.630
Now, it's my turn.

33:18.200 --> 33:21.040
♪ If frost etched traces of weariness ♪

33:22.740 --> 33:24.450
♪ If surging clouds hid the stars ♪

33:26.340 --> 33:29.240
♪ The gaze you once cast upon me ♪

33:30.270 --> 33:32.840
♪ Does it still remember love and hate? ♪

33:34.200 --> 33:37.180
♪ If the rising wind scatters the dust ♪

33:38.450 --> 33:40.210
♪ If every dream must be awakened ♪

33:42.330 --> 33:45.100
♪ How much of the past can we recognize? ♪

33:46.110 --> 33:48.860
♪ In a single thought lies tenderness ♪

33:51.450 --> 33:58.450
♪ Look at the vast heavens,
letting rain fall, indifferent to all ♪

33:56.920 --> 33:58.250
In just a while,

33:58.440 --> 33:59.640
a bitter war will begin.

33:59.520 --> 34:06.420
♪ Watch how time quietly
waits for stories to take root ♪

34:00.640 --> 34:02.590
But I haven't found a sufficient number

34:02.590 --> 34:03.720
of helpers.

34:05.350 --> 34:06.160
Don't worry.

34:06.590 --> 34:08.540
I got a message from Yao Qian,

34:07.180 --> 34:14.050
♪ Look at the way you're going,
destiny has it all planned out ♪

34:08.800 --> 34:09.840
saying that he already found

34:09.840 --> 34:12.230
the hideout
of my uncle's private soldiers.

34:12.230 --> 34:13.030
Really?

34:14.000 --> 34:16.110
Are they willing to help us?

34:15.270 --> 34:25.150
♪ We lead remarkable lives
in this mundane world ♪

34:17.440 --> 34:19.190
About 2,000 soldiers
would like to join us.

34:19.190 --> 34:20.400
What's more, they can reach

34:20.400 --> 34:22.199
the South City before midnight.

34:23.070 --> 34:23.880
That's great.

34:24.710 --> 34:25.719
As long as

34:25.880 --> 34:28.000
we stall Chu Guihong for two more hours,

34:28.000 --> 34:29.590
we will meet our reinforcements

34:29.590 --> 34:31.230
and change our fate against all odds.

34:31.100 --> 34:37.989
♪ Look at the sky, flowers bloom
and fragrance fills the air ♪

34:39.210 --> 34:45.780
♪ The sound of heartbeats
resonates in the passing time ♪

34:46.699 --> 34:53.650
♪ Look at the way you're going,
destiny has it all planned out ♪

34:54.699 --> 35:05.940
♪ We lead remarkable lives
in this mundane world ♪

34:58.590 --> 34:59.190
What's up?

34:59.190 --> 35:00.320
Why are you smiling?

35:01.510 --> 35:02.640
I suddenly recalled

35:03.510 --> 35:05.570
something said by the screenwriter.

35:06.000 --> 35:07.960
He said, in this script world,

35:08.150 --> 35:09.210
each person...

35:09.360 --> 35:12.020
is just
an insignificant fictional character.

35:12.190 --> 35:14.050
But it doesn't seem to be true now.

35:15.280 --> 35:16.070
Look.

35:16.590 --> 35:17.580
Tonight,

35:18.070 --> 35:19.320
each and every

35:19.590 --> 35:20.710
Xuanjia soldier

35:21.150 --> 35:22.360
and Nightwalker

35:22.800 --> 35:24.860
will be writers of this script world.

35:26.920 --> 35:27.720
That's right.

35:28.360 --> 35:29.150
Tonight,

35:29.280 --> 35:30.150
there won't be such thing as

35:30.150 --> 35:32.070
supporting roles or fictional characters.

35:32.070 --> 35:33.730
Everybody will play the lead.

35:35.230 --> 35:36.630
Then, as the female lead,

35:37.110 --> 35:39.310
I must channel all my energy to the show.

35:41.620 --> 35:45.110
[Relay & Receive]

35:43.380 --> 35:44.850
The old Song Yimeng

35:45.670 --> 35:47.670
would love to lay back and slack off,

35:50.960 --> 35:52.600
hoping that one day,

35:53.000 --> 35:54.130
a great hero

35:54.230 --> 35:56.960
would show up
with colorful clouds under his feet

35:57.360 --> 35:59.220
and make all the problems go away.

36:00.760 --> 36:02.960
But now, I've come to realize one thing.

36:03.360 --> 36:04.210
Indeed,

36:04.840 --> 36:06.280
in everyone's life,

36:07.150 --> 36:08.650
there are heroes.

36:09.840 --> 36:11.300
But the biggest one of them

36:12.280 --> 36:13.440
is definitely

36:14.110 --> 36:15.240
the uncompromising

36:16.000 --> 36:17.930
and unyielding his or her own self.

36:23.110 --> 36:24.570
Tonight, let us join hands

36:25.190 --> 36:26.520
to fight as hard as we can

36:26.590 --> 36:27.790
and leave no regrets.

36:32.360 --> 36:33.620
Fight as hard as we can.

36:33.760 --> 36:34.760
Leave no regrets.

36:42.670 --> 36:43.280
Let's go!

36:43.400 --> 36:44.230
Yes!

36:45.440 --> 36:47.330
♪ I ride on the wind
of the waning river crescent ♪

36:48.010 --> 36:49.990
♪ Hate the injustice in the world ♪

36:50.990 --> 36:52.660
♪ Loyalty and righteousness
weigh on both sides of the scale ♪

36:53.220 --> 36:56.130
♪ Wield the knife
to carve a rift in the hell ♪

36:56.960 --> 36:58.280
Qianyu rebels

36:58.440 --> 37:00.040
are endangering Great Jing.

37:00.230 --> 37:01.900
Traitors are running rampant

37:01.310 --> 37:02.370
♪ The waning river crescent sheds light
over the old chess board ♪

37:02.000 --> 37:03.590
and persecuting the loyal.

37:02.640 --> 37:03.650
♪ On the 32 sandalwood tables ♪

37:04.020 --> 37:04.950
♪ The gamblers toss their bucks ♪

37:04.040 --> 37:05.560
All the people

37:05.300 --> 37:06.280
♪ Beneath the dice cup
hide secret letters ♪

37:05.710 --> 37:07.290
shall raise the flag of justice

37:06.620 --> 37:07.590
♪ The storyteller unfolds the story ♪

37:07.800 --> 37:09.230
to protect the sovereign

37:07.880 --> 37:08.980
♪ The code is in the 13th line ♪

37:09.230 --> 37:10.900
and the country!

37:09.300 --> 37:10.340
♪ I dip cold tea to write spy info ♪

37:10.630 --> 37:11.630
♪ The ink seeps into the board ♪

37:11.970 --> 37:13.840
Protect Great Jing!

37:12.050 --> 37:14.240
♪ Half a wall falls
in the golden celestial palace ♪

37:14.550 --> 37:16.150
Protect Great Jing!

37:14.720 --> 37:16.490
♪ The storyteller closes his fan
and shakes the dice cup ♪

37:17.150 --> 37:18.010
At nine tonight,

37:17.350 --> 37:19.180
♪ As the moon sinks to the west,
dawn light shines on the corridor ♪

37:18.110 --> 37:19.070
The main forces of the Nightwalkers and I

37:19.070 --> 37:21.030
will lure Chu Guihong
to Anhe Pier in the South City.

37:19.740 --> 37:21.860
♪ We've all hidden in the market
and released chimney smoke ♪

37:21.590 --> 37:22.840
Large troops can't pass through

37:22.840 --> 37:24.510
the narrow streets in the South City.

37:22.840 --> 37:24.630
♪ The pawnshop owner weeps,
counting silver notes ♪

37:24.550 --> 37:26.400
So, Qianyu Army will have to
split up and take three routes,

37:25.160 --> 37:27.550
♪ The pledged military order
is now riddled with decay ♪

37:26.440 --> 37:28.200
if they are to unite with Chu Guihong.

37:28.200 --> 37:30.060
♪ A wine banner
pierces the midnight haze ♪

37:28.280 --> 37:29.980
Shangguan He, Yunlong, Shanhu and you

37:29.980 --> 37:31.440
are responsible for ambushing

37:30.720 --> 37:32.630
♪ A secret stronghold
lies dormant on the canal map ♪

37:31.440 --> 37:33.000
Chu Guihong's reinforcements.

37:33.000 --> 37:33.800
Rest assured.

37:33.370 --> 37:35.200
♪ I ride on the wind
of the waning river crescent ♪

37:33.880 --> 37:35.150
Our people have lain in ambush

37:35.150 --> 37:36.400
on these three routes.

37:36.300 --> 37:38.200
♪ Hate the injustice in the world ♪

37:39.060 --> 37:40.690
♪ Loyalty and righteousness
weigh on both sides of the scale ♪

37:41.340 --> 37:43.840
♪ Wield the knife
to carve a rift in the hell ♪

37:48.670 --> 37:49.510
Then,

37:49.550 --> 37:51.130
Fugui will lead 300 Xuanjia soldiers

37:51.130 --> 37:52.230
to accompany Rui

37:52.230 --> 37:54.000
to rescue the Emperor in the palace.

37:54.000 --> 37:54.800
God of Earth,

37:54.880 --> 37:55.870
Bodhisattva,

37:56.000 --> 37:56.670
Dragon King,

37:56.670 --> 37:57.400
Kitchen God,

37:57.400 --> 37:58.110
and...

37:58.110 --> 37:58.840
God of Wealth,

37:58.840 --> 37:59.720
Lord Guan,

37:59.960 --> 38:00.760
today,

38:00.920 --> 38:01.980
I'm leading a troop

38:02.630 --> 38:05.320
to defend the royal palace.

38:06.190 --> 38:07.400
I am heaven's chosen one,

38:07.400 --> 38:08.190
the symbol of good fortune.

38:08.190 --> 38:09.000
You will

38:09.070 --> 38:10.590
look out for me, won't you?

38:10.840 --> 38:11.550
Please bless me,

38:11.550 --> 38:12.480
my father

38:12.500 --> 38:13.400
and Heng

38:13.400 --> 38:14.760
to return safely,

38:14.760 --> 38:15.880
to triumph over adversity

38:15.880 --> 38:16.800
and to bring victory home.

38:16.800 --> 38:18.400
I promise I'll place you in a proper room

38:18.400 --> 38:19.360
and present offerings to you.

38:19.360 --> 38:20.230
I'll worship you

38:20.230 --> 38:21.070
with the same food I eat.

38:21.070 --> 38:21.800
Okay?

38:21.800 --> 38:22.630
Please.

38:22.630 --> 38:23.440
Your Highness,

38:23.440 --> 38:24.570
it's time to set out.

38:25.070 --> 38:25.880
Coming right up.

38:25.880 --> 38:26.590
No need to cover them up.

38:26.270 --> 38:27.280
♪ The waning river crescent sheds light
over the old chess board ♪

38:26.590 --> 38:27.540
I saw everything.

38:27.540 --> 38:28.610
♪ On the 32 sandalwood tables ♪

38:27.840 --> 38:29.320
Compared with those irrelevant divinities,

38:28.920 --> 38:29.970
♪ The gamblers toss their bucks ♪

38:29.320 --> 38:30.610
maybe I'm more of help.

38:30.200 --> 38:31.230
♪ Beneath the dice cup
hide secret letters ♪

38:31.070 --> 38:32.150
Don't talk nonsense!

38:31.520 --> 38:32.550
♪ The storyteller unfolds the story ♪

38:32.150 --> 38:32.920
Get a move on.

38:32.910 --> 38:33.900
♪ The code is in the 13th line ♪

38:33.630 --> 38:34.280
Fugui!

38:34.200 --> 38:35.240
♪ I dip cold tea to write spy info ♪

38:34.280 --> 38:35.070
Wait up!

38:35.530 --> 38:36.700
♪ The ink seeps into the board ♪

38:36.840 --> 38:37.360
Fugui!

38:38.670 --> 38:39.480
Oh.

38:39.480 --> 38:40.280
Good heavens!

38:41.230 --> 38:42.360
Why not help me?

38:43.510 --> 38:45.110
Carry these for me, will you?

38:45.150 --> 38:45.990
Fugui!

38:46.760 --> 38:47.450
Fugui!

38:47.490 --> 38:48.530
Junior General,

38:48.960 --> 38:51.110
the Qianyu soldiers
outside the city have assembled.

38:51.110 --> 38:52.400
Once you give an order,

38:52.400 --> 38:55.060
they'll hurry to the South City
to unite with us.

38:56.730 --> 38:57.760
Everyone,

38:58.470 --> 38:59.990
set out for the South City

39:00.320 --> 39:01.440
to eliminate all rebels!

39:01.440 --> 39:02.980
Set out for the South City

39:03.070 --> 39:04.590
to eliminate all rebels!

39:05.800 --> 39:07.400
Release!

39:09.400 --> 39:10.500
Let's go!

39:21.900 --> 39:25.940
[Govern with Morals]

40:11.760 --> 40:12.660
Your Majesty,

40:14.030 --> 40:15.920
I'll give you one last chance.

40:17.190 --> 40:20.520
Write an imperial edict
to eradicate Nan Heng the rebel now.

40:21.840 --> 40:24.100
Otherwise, after nine o'clock tonight,

40:24.960 --> 40:27.090
you won't be able to hold a pen anymore.

40:41.810 --> 40:49.270
[Huanning Hall]

40:59.430 --> 41:00.220
Mr. Song,

41:02.230 --> 41:03.160
are you nervous?

41:04.840 --> 41:07.230
I used to be the mighty Minister of War.

41:08.070 --> 41:09.000
I'm not nervous.

41:17.390 --> 41:18.580
Are you really not?

41:20.920 --> 41:22.230
I really am not.

41:26.190 --> 41:26.840
Blow.

41:27.110 --> 41:27.760
Ignite.

41:28.280 --> 41:28.920
Throw.

41:29.360 --> 41:30.240
Hide.

41:30.800 --> 41:31.510
Right?

41:31.840 --> 41:32.400
Right.
